+This is **CSV-first**, not a reporting database or BPMN process analytics engine.
+Each report is a named, **administrator-configured projection of one queryable
+OpenIDM collection** (for example `managed/entraOwnerRequest`). Add a report by
+editing JSON; no Java, dashboard, or new JavaScript code is required.
 
