+CSV from the navigation bar. With multiple configured reports, a simple CSV
+menu appears. An ordinary user cannot read reports, even by calling the API.
+**All auditor-role users can access all configured reports.** Do not configure
+sensitive fields or collections unless that level of access is appropriate.
+
