+The endpoint returns **JSON pages**, not a single CSV HTTP stream. Each page has
+`header`, `csv`, `nextOffset`, `filename`, `report`. Page size is fixed at 500;
+rows are sorted by `_id` and escaped with `;` separators and quoted cells.
+Formula-looking spreadsheet inputs are prefixed to prevent CSV injection.
+The default config reproduces the previous `entraOwnerRequest` history export,
+including the `recordType=ownership_assignment` constant. That field is **not**
