-recertification process/data model is needed before that field can be reported.
-Workflow task timings and campaign metrics are outside this first export.
+**Limitations:** this is a live paged query, not a transactional snapshot.
+Changes during a long export may cause duplicate/missing rows. Report fields
+must exist in the stored process objects. A single report reads a single
+collection: joins, cross-process correlations, SLA calculations and historical
+ownership reconstruction belong downstream (or require an event data model).
 
